      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRITICAL MOMENT (1) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Last start was fifth over 520m at Wentworth Park in a Grade 5 (30.33) but sharper trip suits this time. Goes very well at the journey winning four races. Form from his last run is proving very strong. Can make amends. NANGAR WALLY (2) was safely held last time out, finishing eighth at Q Lakeside over 457m behind Koby Keeping (26.32) in a Grade 5. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Should be about the money. NOBBY (8) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 5th and beaten 8 lengths at Q Lakeside (26.15). Solid formlines coming through his last run. Expected to give a good account. BORNEO TRAVELER (3) can run a bold race on best form.",
